<section class="nx-showcase"><div class="container"><div class="nx-showcase-head"><div><span>THE NEXORA METHOD</span><h2>Good design is<br><em>felt first.</em></h2></div><p>From the first scroll to checkout, every interaction is designed to make discovery feel simple, confident and memorable.</p></div><div class="nx-showcase-grid"><article class="nx-showcase-card nx-card-large"><div class="nx-card-art art-one"></div><div><small>01 / DISCOVER</small><h3>Make the first impression count.</h3></div></article><article class="nx-showcase-card"><div class="nx-card-art art-two"></div><div><small>02 / CHOOSE</small><h3>Give every product room to shine.</h3></div></article><article class="nx-showcase-card"><div class="nx-card-art art-three"></div><div><small>03 / CONVERT</small><h3>Turn confidence into action.</h3></div></article></div></div></section><style>.nx-showcase{padding:120px 0;background:#fff}.nx-showcase-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:50px;margin-bottom:55px}.nx-showcase-head span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.17em;font-weight:900;color:#777}.nx-showcase-head h2{font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,78px);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.07em;margin:20px 0 0}.nx-showcase-head em{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400}.nx-showcase-head p{max-width:390px;color:#696e77;line-height:1.7;font-size:14px}.nx-showcase-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.35fr 1fr 1fr;gap:14px}.nx-showcase-card{background:#f1f0eb;min-height:500px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;overflow:hidden}.nx-card-art{height:340px;margin:0 0 25px;background-size:cover;background-position:center;transition:transform .7s}.nx-showcase-card:hover .nx-card-art{transform:scale(1.04)}.art-one{background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,#d9dde3,#f8f7f2 55%,#b7c0cc)}.art-two{background-image:linear-gradient(155deg,#17181b,#565b64 48%,#d9d6cf)}.art-three{background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,#d8e0d0,#f6f3ea 45%,#9da994)}.nx-showcase-card>div:last-child{padding:0 28px 30px}.nx-showcase-card small{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:900;color:#777}.nx-showcase-card h3{font-size:24px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:12px 0 0;max-width:330px}@media(max-width:800px){.nx-showcase-head{display:block}.nx-showcase-head p{margin-top:25px}.nx-showcase-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.nx-showcase-card{min-height:430px}.nx-card-art{height:270px}} </style>{% schema %}{"name":"Nexora showcase","settings":[],"presets":[{"name":"Nexora showcase"}]}{% endschema %}